  "artifactSource": "Local 2.15 packages built from an LF checkout of the release commit (the CI line endings) on Node 22.22.3 and packed with npm 11.5.1; compared against same-major npm 2.14 packages. Reviewed changes: new SdFileExplorer entry point, sd-side-drawer container input, accessible names for icon-only sd-button, legible light-theme PDF tile in sd-preview-pdf, file-explorer i18n keys and Lucide icon aliases. Export maps only add ./components/file-explorer; dependencies are unchanged; no packed paths or declarations are removed. CI rebuilds from the tagged release commit.",
